  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://count.getloli.com/@:OneKeyMinerCurseForge?name=:OneKeyMinerCurseForge&theme=minecraft&padding=7&offset=0&align=top&scale=1&pixelated=1&darkmode=auto\" alt=\":OneKeyMinerCurseForge\"></p>\n<h1>🛠️ OneKeyMiner (Forge / NeoForge) – 鏈式採礦與種植模組</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ASVG5n5xAg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/your-server-id?label=Discord&logo=discord&color=7289DA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>   <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/onekeyminer-nf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-FF4500?logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fonekeyminer_nf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-28A745?logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>   <a href=\"https://github.com/Mai-xiyu/OneKeyMiner-issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Report-Bug-red?style=flat\" alt=\"回報錯誤\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fonekeyminer-chainable-visuals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/OneKeyMiner-Chainable Visuals-1BD96A?logo=modrinth&labelColor=1E2328\" alt=\"OneKeyMiner 鏈式視覺效果 | Modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/onekeyminer-chainable-visuals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/OneKeyMiner-Chainable Visuals-FF6B00?logo=curseforge&labelColor=1E2328\" alt=\"OneKeyMiner 鏈式視覺效果 | CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/onekeyminer-nf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1078620?label=CurseForge&color=FF4500&logo=none\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fonekeyminer_nf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/onekeyminer_nf?label=Modrinth&color=28A745&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a></p>\n<h2>📋 模組介紹</h2>\n<p>OneKeyMiner 為 Forge 與 NeoForge 平台帶來流暢的鏈式採礦與種植體驗。按住您指定的按鍵（預設：<code>~</code>），即可自動破壞相鄰的同類方塊，或批量種植種子。兩個版本的核心功能完全相同，均包含採礦、種植及工具耐久度保護；NeoForge 版本則進一步擴充了互動功能。</p>",
